From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 06:24:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Color each Markdown heading level

Give each ATX heading marker and title its own Austin Night color,
and use the level 1 and 2 colors for setext headings.
---
 src/highlighter.rs       | 88 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 themes/austin-night.json | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/highlighter.rs b/src/highlighter.rs
